nd bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","type":"topic","title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/layoutValue(key:value:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/layoutValue(key:value:)","title":"layoutValue(key:value:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"layoutValue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"K"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"K"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"K"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14LayoutValueKeyP0D0Qa","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/layoutvalue(key:value:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami"}}}